<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>ExtraMojo – collections</title><link>https://extramojo.github.io/ExtraMojo/extramojo/collections/</link><description>Recent content in collections on ExtraMojo</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><atom:link href="https://extramojo.github.io/ExtraMojo/extramojo/collections/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>bitvec</title><link>https://extramojo.github.io/ExtraMojo/extramojo/collections/bitvec/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://extramojo.github.io/ExtraMojo/extramojo/collections/bitvec/</guid><description>
&lt;p>Mojo module &lt;a href="https://github.com/ExtraMojo/ExtraMojo/blob/main/extramojo/collections/bitvec.mojo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">🡭&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;h1>&lt;code>bitvec&lt;/code>&lt;/h1>&lt;p>Provides a growable bitfield.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Optimized for space (1 bit per element) and speed (O(1) operations).
Offers set/clear/test/toggle and fast population count. The underlying
storage grows automatically but does not shrink unless &lt;code>shrink_to_fit&lt;/code>
is called (not implemented yet).&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Example:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx-relative hx-mt-6 first:hx-mt-0 hx-group/code ">
&lt;div>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-mojo" data-lang="mojo">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="k">var&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="nv">bv&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">BitVec&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">length&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">128&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">fill&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kc">False&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="c1"># 128-bit set, all clear&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">bv.set&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">42&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="c1"># Mark value 42 as present.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">bv&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">42&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="c1"># Check membership, could use bv.test(42)&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="nb">print&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;hit&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="c1"># Prints &amp;#34;hit&amp;#34;.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">bv.clear&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">42&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="c1"># Remove 42.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="nb">print&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">bv.count_set_bits&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">())&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="c1"># Prints 0.&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx-opacity-0 hx-transition group-hover/code:hx-opacity-100 hx-flex hx-gap-1 hx-absolute hx-m-[11px] hx-right-0 hx-top-0">
